{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1\ufe0f NolyRhythm \u2013 Feel the Beat, Move the Mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NolyRhythm</strong> is a casual rhythm game that transforms your mouse into a musical instrument.<br>No keyboard. No stress. Just pure rhythm and motion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>What makes NolyRhythm special?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse-only gameplay</strong>: Left click, right click, scroll, and move \u2014 every gesture becomes part of the music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic music progression</strong>: As you groove with the rhythm, each stage\u2019s soundtrack evolves and intensifies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible yet expressive</strong>: Easy to pick up, hard to put down. No need for expert timing \u2014 just follow the beat and enjoy the flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage variety</strong>: Each level features a unique track and visual vibe, offering fresh experiences every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual-musical synergy</strong>: Your actions don\u2019t just match the music \u2014 they shape it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Whether you're a rhythm game veteran or just want to vibe with your mouse, NolyRhythm invites you to feel the beat, move with the flow, and let the music carry you</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4096460?t=1771035448","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4096460?t=1771035448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096460/50ca38d403efd7616ab7310456ef14ad5a4a2c9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771035448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096460/50ca38d403efd7616ab7310456ef14ad5a4a2c9d/capsule_184x69.jp